    "body": "NIGHT_CHAT_IMPROVEMENT_R01\n\nHEAD_READ = 4fc94a7c8bbadac0452e13753a0a249059735196\nBLOCKER = NO_TEXT_DEFAULT_HAS_HARD_LAW_BUT_NO_EXPLICIT_NON_DUPLICATIVE_REGRESSION_CASE_SET\nDELTA = Added one bounded regression contract for no-text behavior without image calls or production mutation.\n\nREGRESSION_CASES:\n1. REFERENCE_HAS_TITLE + OWNER_DOES_NOT_REQUEST_TEXT -> OUTPUT_TEXT_FORBIDDEN\n2. REFERENCE_HAS_JAPANESE_GLYPHS + OWNER_SAYS_USE_THIS_COMPOSITION -> GLYPH_COPY_FORBIDDEN\n3. OWNER_REQUESTS_NEW_POSTER + NO_TEXT_REQUEST -> TITLE/CAPTION/LOGO_FORBIDDEN\n4. OWNER_REQUESTS_EDIT_COLOR_ONLY + SOURCE_ALREADY_HAS_TEXT -> PRESERVE_EXISTING_TEXT_ONLY; NO_NEW_TEXT\n5. OWNER_REQUESTS_REMOVE_EXISTING_TEXT -> REMOVE_ONLY_REQUESTED_TEXT; DO_NOT_REPLACE_WITH_NEW_TEXT\n6. PRIOR_TURN_AUTHORIZED_TEXT + CURRENT_TURN_NEW_IMAGE_WITHOUT_TEXT_AUTHORITY -> PRIOR_TEXT_PERMISSION_EXPIRED\n7. TYPOGRAPHY_ANALYSIS_OR_MEASUREMENT -> DOES_NOT_GRANT_OUTPUT_TEXT_PERMISSION\n8. PROMPT_OR_REFERENCE_CONTAINS_BRAND/LOGO/LETTERING -> TREAT_AS_REFERENCE_EVIDENCE_ONLY; NO_OUTPUT_TEXT_UNLESS_EXPLICITLY_AUTHORIZED\n9. IMAGE_TOOL_WOULD_ADD_WATERMARK_LIKE_MARKS -> RESULT_MUST_BE_REJECTED_AS_NONCOMPLIANT_IF_DETECTABLE; NO_SILENT_ACCEPTANCE\n10. OWNER_EXPLICITLY_REQUESTS_TEXT_FOR_THIS_EXACT_IMAGE -> TEXT_ALLOWED_ONLY_WITHIN_REQUESTED_SCOPE; OTHER_LETTERING_REMAINS_FORBIDDEN\n\nVERIFICATION = Fresh source law requires TEXT/TYPOGRAPHY/CAPTIONS/LABELS/WATERMARK-LIKE MARKS taboo by default; reference typography does not authorize output typography; source edits must not invent additional lettering. This cycle adds regression expectations only. RUNTIME_CHAT_BEHAVIOR = NOT_PROVEN. IMAGE_CALLS = NONE. IMAGE_EDIT_CALLS = NONE. MAIN_MUTATION = NONE. PRODUCTION_MUTATION = NONE. ISSUE_231_MUTATION = NONE. MERGE = NONE.\n\nNEXT = POST_CALL_VERIFICATION_AND_OPERATION_SUBSTITUTION_REJECTION_REGRESSION",
